flowchart TD
    Start([User opens Patients]) --> Role{User role?}

    Role -->|SuperAdmin Staff| AllPatients[View all patients]
    Role -->|Doctor| DoctorPatients[View only linked patients]
    Role -->|Admin| AllPatients

    AllPatients --> Action{Action?}
    DoctorPatients --> Action

    Action -->|Create| CreateForm[Open Create form]
    Action -->|View| Details[Open Patient Details]
    Action -->|Edit| EditForm[Open Edit form]
    Action -->|Delete| DeleteCheck{Has blocking records?}

    CreateForm --> ValidateCreate{Valid data?}
    ValidateCreate -->|No| CreateForm
    ValidateCreate -->|Yes| SavePatient[Save Patient and Clinical History]
    SavePatient --> Details

    EditForm --> ValidateEdit{Valid data?}
    ValidateEdit -->|No| EditForm
    ValidateEdit -->|Yes| UpdatePatient[Update patient record]
    UpdatePatient --> Details

    DeleteCheck -->|Yes| Error[Show delete error]
    DeleteCheck -->|No| Remove[Delete patient]
    Error --> AllPatients
    Remove --> AllPatients

    Details --> AIChoice{Start analysis?}
    AIChoice -->|Gummy Smile| GS[Go to Gummy Smile wizard]
    AIChoice -->|X-Ray| XR[Go to X-Ray analysis]
    AIChoice -->|No| End([Done])

    GS --> End
    XR --> End
